flowchart TD
    A([Start PawPal+]) --> B[Open Streamlit App]

    B --> C{Owner exists in session?}
    C -- No --> D[Create Owner object]
    C -- Yes --> E[Load Owner from session state]

    D --> F[Display Pet Information]
    E --> F

    F --> G{Add a Pet?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Create Pet object]
    H --> I[Add Pet to Owner]
    I --> F
    G -- No --> J{Add a Task?}

    J -- Yes --> K[Enter Task Details]
    K --> L[Create Task object]
    L --> M[Add Task to Pet]
    M --> N[Generate Today's Schedule]

    J -- No --> N

    N --> O[Find Tasks Due Today]
    O --> P[Sort Tasks by Time]
    P --> Q[Filter Tasks if Needed]
    Q --> R{Scheduling Conflict?}

    R -- Yes --> S[Display Conflict Warning]
    R -- No --> T[Display Daily Schedule]

    S --> T
    T --> U{Recurring Task Completed?}

    U -- Yes --> V{Frequency}
    V -- Daily --> W[Create Task for Next Day]
    V -- Weekly --> X[Create Task for Next Week]
    V -- Once --> Y[No New Task]

    U -- No --> Z[Continue Managing Tasks]

    W --> Z
    X --> Z
    Y --> Z

    Z --> AA([End])

    fclassDiagram